    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the hidden sanctuary of the Grand Wizard Aldous, a master of dimensional magic who has mysteriously vanished. The room is filled with esoteric artifacts, glowing crystals, and strange mechanical devices pulsing with magical energy. A central pedestal displays a message etched in glowing runes: 'Only those who can harmonize the celestial energies and decode the arcane secrets may unlock the ultimate treasure chest and inherit my legacy.' You must carefully study the ancient tools, magical terminals, and celestial sundials scattered around the room to find the correct path of activation. Your final objective is to obtain the master key hidden deep within the ultimate treasure chest. The secrets of the universe await.",
